0.9.0
- Replace Unsummon skill with Pack Link (6t: 20% of summon damage heals you).
- Mend Pack now requires Pack Link.
- RMB Unsummon remains the safe-dismiss path (with Inspect / Swap).

0.8.1
- RMB on summons: Unsummon (safe dismiss, keeps XP) alongside Inspect and Swap.

0.8.0
- Rebuild package for ModShardLauncher Enhanced / Nexus .sml release.


0.7.9
- Hunt Command applies a visible Hunt Mark debuff; summons get Hunt Focus (+12% damage / +10% accuracy) vs the mark.

0.7.8
- Fix summons not following: do not clear the player as a target; follow when no valid hostile.

0.7.7
- Fix servant crash: only read combat-target state on real units.

0.7.6
- Summons no longer hunt Neutral/Mercenary/town NPCs or caravan followers; re-stick ally flags so they stay non-hostile.

0.7.5
- Fix AddFunction order so scr_sm_level_get exists before callers (startup crash).

0.7.4
- Companion kill XP hook is assembly-only (o_enemy Destroy cannot ReplaceGML).

0.7.3
- Fix summon kill XP patch when Necromancy already renumbered assembly labels.

0.7.2
- Summons no longer attack Unaware (idle) NPCs; Hunt Command marks still override.
- Inspect window shows companion Level, XP, and level-up parameter bonuses.

0.7.1
- Unsummon now safe-dismisses (no Morale death debuff).
- Summoned pets leave no corpse/remains on death or dismiss.

0.7.0
- Localize skills, buffs, and school hover into EN / RU / ZH / DE / JA (Stoneshard top languages).

0.6.1
- Fix missing skill descriptions (table_skills desc rows were skipped after name insert).
- Tier 2 locks until its corresponding Tier 1 is learned (Hunt→Howl, Wolf→Instincts, Unsummon→Mend).
- Gate higher tiers with can_learn like vanilla/Necromancy (no free unlock).

0.6.0
- Move Summoner school to the Magic (Sorcery) skill column.
- Restore skill-tree background (locks + links) on s_summoner_tree.
- Tier 2 unlocks when any Tier 1 skill is learned (not a specific column).
- Fix skill hover crash: active icons now copy desc via event_perform_object(child_skill).

0.5.2
- Fix skill menu coexistence with Necromancy (inject category instead of ReplaceBy wipe).
- Drop bogus category owner script assignment.

0.5.1
- Fix Pack Instincts / Kindred Spirit Create: passives no longer reference missing child_skill objects.

0.5.0
- Fix startup crash: map-travel unsummon hook no longer tears apart location/room scripts (playerGridX).
- Fix skill menu crash: add Summoner to table_text Tier_name / skilltree_hover (string_height_ext undefined).

0.4.0
- Summon RMB context menu: Inspect (Explore) and tile Swap with the player (adjacent).
- Swap works while summons are idle (vanilla gate blocked idle neutrals).
- Fix AddFunction order so scr_sm_apply_level_stats exists before scr_sm_bind_summon (startup crash).

0.3.0
- Hunt Command aura recolored red; Kindred Spirit icon recolored green.
- Skill deps: T3 requires any T2; T4 requires any T3 only (no T2→T4 skips); T2 still gated by T1.
- Alpha's Howl 8 turns; Savage Bond 10 turns; Primal Apex 6 turns.

0.2.0
- Arcane Bestiary skill icons (frameless extracts) for all 13 skills.
- Summon death applies temporary Morale debuff for 600 turns (does not stack); Kindred still halves.
- Per-summon XP / HP / damage / armor progression tables on each summon skill.

0.1.0
- Initial Summoner school scaffold: 13 skills, per-species XP tracks, balance pass.
- Summons dismiss safely when changing map tiles / rooms (XP kept, no Morale loss).
- Skill icons and .sml build pipeline.
